  "description": "Connects the OASIS to ThreeFold -- a peer-to-peer Internet infrastructure platform providing decentralised compute, storage, and networking via the TF Grid. Stores OASIS holons and avatar data on ThreeFold's sovereign, carbon-neutral, self-healing global cloud. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
